          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezira yaazaala: Yetheri, Meredi, Eferi, ni Yaloni. Meredi yaabayiza Bithia mughala wa kyabazinga w'e Misiri, baazaala omwana omughala nga ni Miriamu, era baazaala n'abaana abalenzi babiri: Shammai ni Ishiba. Ishiba oyo yaazaala Eshitemoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meredi yaabayiza n'omukazi Omuyudaaya, baazaala abaana abalenzi basatu: Yeredi eyazaala Gedori, Heberi eyazaala Soko, ni Yekuthieli eyazaala Zanoa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
